<Slide style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>混淆矩阵与误差分析</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#BBD0EF' }}>03 · 实验与评估</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', padding: 32, gap: 32, alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '54%', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8', marginBottom: 10 }}>混淆矩阵（行=真实，列=预测，每类 200 样本）</Text>
      <Table
        style={{ width: '100%', height: 380 }}
        defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 12, textAlign: 'center', color: '#1A2230' }}
        defaultCellStyle={{ border: { left: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' }, right: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' }, top: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' }, bottom: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' } }, padding: 7 }}
        cells={[
          [{ text: '', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } }, { text: 'normal', textStyle: { color: '#fff', bold: true }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } }, { text: 'dos', textStyle: { color: '#fff', bold: true }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } }, { text: 'scan', textStyle: { color: '#fff', bold: true }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } }, { text: 'brute', textStyle: { color: '#fff', bold: true }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } }, { text: 'exfil', textStyle: { color: '#fff', bold: true }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } }],
          [{ text: 'normal', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#fff' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } }, { text: '196', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } }, { text: '1', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#FDECEC' } } }, { text: '0' }, { text: '3', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#FDECEC' } } }, { text: '0' }],
          [{ text: 'dos', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#fff' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } }, { text: '2', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#FDECEC' } } }, { text: '198', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } }, { text: '0' }, { text: '0' }, { text: '0' }],
          [{ text: 'scan', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#fff' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } }, { text: '1', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#FDECEC' } } }, { text: '0' }, { text: '197', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } }, { text: '1', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#FDECEC' } } }, { text: '1', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#FDECEC' } } }],
          [{ text: 'brute', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#fff' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } }, { text: '0' }, { text: '0' }, { text: '0' }, { text: '200', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } }, { text: '0' }],
          [{ text: 'exfil', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#fff' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } }, { text: '0' }, { text: '0' }, { text: '0' }, { text: '0' }, { text: '200', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } }],
        ]}
      />
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', marginBottom: 2 }}>误差来源分析</Text>
      <Box style={{ background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 16, borderLeft: '4px solid #D9534F' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
          误判集中在 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>normal ↔ port_scan</span> 边界：低速扫描统计形态接近高频正常访问；单连接特征存在理论极限，需时间序列聚合缓解。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 40, borderTop: '1px solid #D6DCE5', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'flex-end', paddingRight: 40 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>10 / 13</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
